  "identity": "Short curly brown hair, adult human proportions, blue-gray work jumpsuit with rolled sleeves, dark webbing and light sneakers, M41A only; same Aliens1986 selection as the W13 source definition.",
  "actionReview": [
    "Locomotion uses articulated adult bodies and a slung rifle. Crouches and prone defeats remain shorter; no per-row resizing to force equal height.",
    "Close light moves use physical stock/forearm/kick contact. Release/special have conventional barrel flash only on the declared contact pose and no flash on recovery.",
    "Guard/parry is physical, without a drawn bubble. Charge is physical preparation, without magic. Aerial states are ordinary human motions adapted to platform combat.",
    "Ledge catch/hang retain connected bare hand/wrist/forearm and slung rifle. The corrected climb raises torso from below the palm to above it; all four lower bodies are complete.",
    "No initial reference pose is reused as a full45 native drawing. Rejected initial rows and cropped studies remain archived and uncounted."
